OL,3,ADementia patient's deportation delayed
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man with dementia will be able to
OL,6,Fremain in Sweden while a legal bid to
OL,7,Fdelay his deportation is considered.
OL,9,FThe Swedish authorities said they
OL,10,Fwanted George Mason, originally from
OL,11,FHinckley in Leicestershire, to leave
OL,12,Fthe country by midnight on 20 August,
OL,13,Fafter his application for permanent
OL,14,Fresidency was rejected.
OL,16,FMason's daughter, Michelle Torossian,
OL,17,Fsaid the family had been told an
OL,18,Finjunction to halt his deportation
OL,19,Fwould be decided by Swedish authorities
OL,20,Fin a timeframe of two weeks to six
OL,21,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
