OL,3,ADementia patient's deportation delayed
OL,4,
OL,5,FTorossian said she was told by the
OL,6,FBritish Embassy in Stockholm that the
OL,7,Foriginal deportation decision would not
OL,8,Fbe enforced by the authorities while
OL,9,Fthe injunction order was considered.
